  "note": "Used in the last step of Cor 8.0.2 ('remembering to add (8.50)'). For δ ≠ 0, one of |F_δ(s+k)| and |F_δ(1−s+k)| is in the main case (8.1) and the other in the same-sign case; for δ = 0 both are same-sign. 4·10⁻⁷ is added to the c₂ bounds in κ_{k,0}, and 6·10⁻⁵ to the c₁ bounds in κ_{k,1}."
